## Centrar texto##

<div class="col75p terminal example">
&lt;div style="
     width: 200px; height: <span class=focus>100px</span>; 
     background: #228; color: white; 
     border-radius: 10px; 
     margin: auto; 
     position: relative; 
     top: 50%;
     margin-top: -50px;
     <span class=focus>line-height: 100px</span>; 
     <span class=focus>text-align: center</span>;"> OK &lt;/div>
</div>
<div class=col25p style="height: 280px;">
<div style="width: 100px; height: 100px; background: #228; color: white; border-radius: 10px; margin: auto; position: relative; top: 50%; margin-top: -50px;line-height: 100px; text-align: center;">OK</div>

</div>

* Centrar horizontalmente: <code class=focus>text-align: center</code>
* Centrar verticalmente: <code class=focus>line-height: 100px</code>
* Notar que a altura do botão e da linha são iguais <code class=focus>100px</code>